-- Singapore Penal Code 1871 — tests of the seat layer.
--
-- SEAT: the accused person. Every fixture and every expected value below is
-- copied from an assertion in the existing modules, which were hand-checked
-- against the reported cases and the Illustrations; none is computed afresh.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `penal-code-seat`
IMPORT `theft-378-379`
IMPORT `misappropriation-403`
IMPORT `cbt-405-406`
IMPORT `cbt-407-409`
IMPORT `cheating-415-417-420`
IMPORT `extortion-383-384`
IMPORT `robbery-390-392`
IMPORT `criminal-intimidation-503-506`
IMPORT `hurt-321-323A`
IMPORT `culpable-homicide-301`
IMPORT `charge-sheet`

§ `Taking or keeping someone else's property`

-- theft-378-379.l4, s 378 Illustration (q) and its variants
#ASSERT `Have I committed theft` `Lim Wei Ming`
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I committed theft` `Lim Wei Ming, not dishonestly`)
#ASSERT `What can I be made to suffer for theft under section 379` `Lim Wei Ming` EQUALS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to 3 years, or with fine, or with both"
#ASSERT `Can I be punished for theft in a dwelling under section 380` `Tan Mei Ling, in the supermarket`
#ASSERT NOT (`Can I be punished for theft in a dwelling under section 380` `Tan Mei Ling, in the open`)

-- misappropriation-403.l4, s 403 Illustrations
#ASSERT `Have I dishonestly misappropriated property` `the umbrella taken by mistake`
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I dishonestly misappropriated property` `the dollar on the high road`)

§ `Property entrusted to me`

-- cbt-405-406.l4, Carl Elias Moses
#ASSERT `Have I committed criminal breach of trust` `Carl Elias Moses, the charge amended`
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I committed criminal breach of trust` `Carl Elias Moses, as charged`)

-- cbt-407-409.l4
#ASSERT `Can I be punished under section 408 as an employee` `Carl Elias Moses, as an employee of the company`
#ASSERT NOT (`Can I be punished under section 408 as an employee` `Carl Elias Moses, as a director of the company`)
#ASSERT `What can I be made to suffer under section 409` `Carl Elias Moses, as a director of the company` EQUALS "imprisonment for a term which may extend to 20 years, and shall also be liable to fine"

§ `Deceiving or threatening someone`

-- cheating-415-417-420.l4, Lewis Christine
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I cheated` `Lewis Christine, no deception`)
#ASSERT `Can I be charged under section 420` `Lewis Christine`
#ASSERT NOT (`Can I be charged under section 420` `Lewis Christine, fraudulently only`)

-- extortion-383-384.l4, Sarjit Singh Rapati
#ASSERT `Have I committed extortion` `Sarjit Singh Rapati`
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I committed extortion` `Sarjit Singh Rapati, no dishonest inducement`)

-- robbery-390-392.l4, Chen Weixiong Jerriek and s 390 Illustration (b)
#ASSERT `Have I committed robbery` `Chen Weixiong Jerriek`
#ASSERT `Have I committed robbery` `Illustration (b) to section 390`
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I committed robbery` `Chen Weixiong Jerriek, no aggravation`)
#ASSERT `Can I be punished for attempted robbery under section 393` `Chen Weixiong Jerriek, the attempt`
#ASSERT NOT (`Can I be punished for attempted robbery under section 393` `Chen Weixiong Jerriek`)
#ASSERT `Can I be punished for hurt caused in a robbery under section 394` `Chen Weixiong Jerriek`
#ASSERT NOT (`Can I be punished for hurt caused in a robbery under section 394` `Chen Weixiong Jerriek, the getaway, no occasion`)

-- criminal-intimidation-503-506.l4, Chan Yok Tuang and s 503 Illustration
#ASSERT `Have I committed criminal intimidation` `Chan Yok Tuang, with intent to alarm`
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I committed criminal intimidation` `Chan Yok Tuang, the facts as they were`)
#ASSERT `Does the heavier punishment under section 506 apply to me` `Chan Yok Tuang, with intent to alarm`
#ASSERT NOT (`Does the heavier punishment under section 506 apply to me` `Chan Yok Tuang, threat not aggravated`)

§ `Someone hurt or killed`

-- hurt-321-323A.l4, Ang Boon Han
#ASSERT `Have I voluntarily caused hurt` `Ang Boon Han`
#ASSERT NOT (`Have I voluntarily caused hurt` `Ang Boon Han, no hurt caused`)
#ASSERT `Can I be punished under section 323A for grievous hurt I did not intend` `Ang Boon Han`
#ASSERT NOT (`Can I be punished under section 323A for grievous hurt I did not intend` `Ang Boon Han, the hurt intended was grievous`)

-- culpable-homicide-301.l4
#ASSERT `Is the death I caused judged by what I intended for someone else` `A shoots at B and kills C`
#ASSERT NOT (`Is the death I caused judged by what I intended for someone else` `A stones a crowd and kills C`)
#ASSERT `Is a defence or exception in law available to me` `A shoots at B in private defence and kills C`
#ASSERT NOT (`Is a defence or exception in law available to me` `A shoots at B and kills C`)

§ `What I can be charged with`

-- charge-sheet.l4
#ASSERT `What can I be charged with` `Lewis Christine's complaint` EQUALS LIST "420", "417"
#ASSERT `What can I be charged with` `Tan Mei Ling's complaint, in the open` EQUALS LIST "379"
#ASSERT `What can I be charged with` `the dollar found on the high road` EQUALS EMPTY
